          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "60785e2552404d0070bf1d34",
           "text": "@Danny Bernstein"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": ", I didn't see the issues described in this ticket.  Are you sure you removed the existing config file (they don't get overwritten if one already exists)?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "But I did see that the auditLog parameter wasn't added to the config, and there weren't any tests for the serialized version, so I fixed those:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
