      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/16",
       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65/9af2a4f1-6b52-480b-a69f-d59b265be598/48"
      },
      "displayName": "Esmé Cowles",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "attrs": {
           "accessLevel": "",
           "id": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
           "text": "@Andrew Woods"
          },
          "type": "mention"
         },
         {
          "text": ", I'm not sure I understand ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "attrs": {
           "url": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-2430#icft=FCREPO-2430"
          },
          "type": "inlineCard"
         },
         {
          "text": " (or it doesn't line up with my understanding of how the utility operations).  My understanding is that we are writing the command-line options to a YAML file if it doesn't exist already, but that we don't use that file in any way unless the --config option is included in the command line.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "So I *think* the most likely explanation is that an old config file existed with the default options, and that's why the values don't match the command-line arguments.  But is there something else going on here?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
