      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" data-account-id=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" accountid=\"60785e2552404d0070bf1d34\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Danny Bernstein</a>, I didn't see the issues described in this ticket.  Are you sure you removed the existing config file (they don't get overwritten if one already exists)?</p>\n\n<p>But I did see that the auditLog parameter wasn't added to the config, and there weren't any tests for the serialized version, so I fixed those:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/91\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-labs/fcrepo-import-export/pull/91</a></p>",
