       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" data-account-id=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" accountid=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Esmé Cowles</a>: it is conceivable that some of the confusion (if there is indeed no bug with config files) may be related to: <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2430\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2430</a></p>",
