  "description": "<p>I exported my repo using the following command:</p>\n\n<p>java -jar target/fcrepo-import-export-0.1.1-SNAPSHOT.jar -d ~/import-export-sprint-3/data-export-as-bag  -m export -a -b -r <a href=\"http://localhost:8686/f4/rest\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8686/f4/rest</a> -g default -G ~/import-export-sprint-3/config-files/bagit-profile.yml </p>\n\n<p>The resulting importexport.yml looks like this: </p>\n\n<p>mode: export<br/>\nexternal: false<br/>\npredicates: <a href=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#contains</a><br/>\noverwriteTombstones: false<br/>\nresource: <a href=\"http://localhost:8080/rest/1\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://localhost:8080/rest/1</a><br/>\nbag-profile: default<br/>\nbag-config: path/config.yaml<br/>\ndir: /tmp/rdf<br/>\nbinaries: false<br/>\nrdfLang: text/turtle</p>\n\n<p>Notice resource, binaries, bag-config, resource, and possibly predicates are simply using default values not the ones specified by the command line.</p>",
